<%- | Array[Integer] $ports, String $journal | -%>
AdPulse AWS host hardening report
Managed by Puppet (OpenVox), class adpulse::host

Controls applied:
1. Deploy user adpulse: SSH key only (password locked), member of docker
2. sshd: PermitRootLogin no, PasswordAuthentication no, KbdInteractiveAuthentication no, MaxAuthTries 3
3. ufw: default deny incoming; allowed tcp ports: <%= $ports.join(', ') %> (allowed before enabling)
   Note: Docker-published ports bypass ufw; the AWS security group (my IP /32) is the boundary
4. unattended-upgrades enabled (daily lists + upgrades)
5. sysctl: no ICMP redirects or source routing, syncookies, kptr/dmesg restricted, protected links
6. journald capped at <%= $journal %>, 7 days retention
